# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

files is project
files purpose "Write a file under build/, read it back, and try to read outside build/; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
files target console
files version "0.1.0"
files language refined 1
files standardLibrary 1
files allows write console.stdout none
files allows read fs.files "build/"
files allows write fs.files "build/"
files requires none
files includesModule files
files entry files.main
